    57	#  10 verdict unusable (missing file/field, wildcard, wrong tag, bad parent)
    58	#  11 the assert would be VACUOUS (the verdict is not inside the delta it
    59	#     anchors — e.g. parent_sha == HEAD, which makes the verdict review itself)
    60	#  12 parent_sha is not an ancestor of HEAD (a fabricated/orphan anchor:
    61	#     `cat-file -e` proves existence, not lineage — a `commit-tree` object
    62	#     carrying HEAD's own tree makes diff(parent..HEAD) contain only the
    63	#     verdict while unreviewed work sits on main)
    64	#  13 the verdict DECISION does not authorize a release (NO-GO, absent,
    65	#     empty, or an unknown token), OR the block spells a top-level key in a
    66	#     form this reader and the step-15 validator resolve differently.
    67	#     PLAN-177 W0.1 / P1-4: this guard read the tag, the anchor, the
    68	#     allowlist and the manifest of a verdict but never its DECISION, so a
    69	#     cross-model NO-GO still cut a tag. PLAN-177 t2 / P1-a: it then read
    70	#     the DECISION with a grammar the other rail did not share, so
    71	#     `verdict : NO-GO` + `verdict: GO` cut a tag on a NO-GO.
    72	# ============================================================================
    73	"""Ancestry + restricted-delta asserts for the release tag phase."""
    74	
