    20	  `gh release view || gh release create` idempotency; `-rc.N` strip in
    21	  the VERSION + CHANGELOG gates, closing PLAN-152 §Deferred
    22	  release-gate-rc-version-mismatch / red run 28663453202): enforced
    23	  against the STAGED copy while it exists on disk
    24	  (.claude/plans/PLAN-153/staged/wave-B/ is gitignored → absent in CI)
    25	  and against the LIVE workflow once Wave B lands (detected via the
    26	  "PLAN-153 Wave B item 5" marker). They skip only in the pre-landing
    27	  CI window where neither context is available.
    28	
    29	PLAN-166 W1 items 1 + 4 (F1, P0) extend the same dual-context convention
    30	(staged mirror under .claude/plans/PLAN-166/staged/ pre-landing,
    31	"PLAN-166 W1 item 1" marker in the live file post-landing) with:
    32	
    33	- await-gate asserts: the publish OBSERVES release.yml's `release-gate`
