    47	  a COPY of the workflow text must go red.
    48	
    49	PLAN-166 W1-B (F2 server side; merged in by the ceremony assembler —
    50	one runnable asserts file) adds the W1B* classes at the bottom:
    51	structural asserts for release.yml's verdict delta + ancestry gate step
